# Pohybovy skill: zoznam a limity su na topicu /skills/catalog
string skill
float64 value     # vzdialenost [m], uhol [deg] alebo cas [s]; 0 = predvolena hodnota skillu
---
bool success
string status     # ok | invalid_skill | invalid_argument | out_of_range | not_upright | busy | no_imu | timeout | robot_fell | cancelled
string message
float64 value_done
---
string state
float64 progress
float64 value_done
